 "body": "The widget list crashes when it is empty.\r\n\r\n### Steps to reproduce\r\n\r\n1. Open the widget list\r\n2. Remove every widget\r\n3. See the crash\r\n\r\n![crash](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6f1c2e9a-4b7d-4a52-9c3e-0f1d2a3b4c5d)\r\n\r\n### Expected behavior\r\n\r\nAn empty list.\r\n",
 "body_html": "<p dir=\"auto\">The widget list crashes when it is empty.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Steps to reproduce</h3>\n<ol dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Open the widget list</li>\n<li>Remove every widget</li>\n<li>See the crash</li>\n</ol>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/9000001/400000042-6f1c2e9a-4b7d-4a52-9c3e-0f1d2a3b4c5d.png?jwt=REDACTED.fixture.jwt\"><img src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/9000001/400000042-6f1c2e9a-4b7d-4a52-9c3e-0f1d2a3b4c5d.png?jwt=REDACTED.fixture.jwt\" alt=\"crash\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"></a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/3f2a1b0c9d8e7f6a5b4c3d2e1f0a9b8c7d6e5f4a/68747470733a2f2f6578616d706c652e636f6d2f6c6f676f2e706e67\"><img src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/3f2a1b0c9d8e7f6a5b4c3d2e1f0a9b8c7d6e5f4a/68747470733a2f2f6578616d706c652e636f6d2f6c6f676f2e706e67\" alt=\"logo\" data-canonical-src=\"https://example.com/logo.png\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"></a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><img src=\"https://intranet.example/metadata.png\" alt=\"not GitHub's\"> <img src=\"https://github.com/octo-example/widgets/raw/main/x.png\" alt=\"off the assets path\"> <img src=\"http://user-images.githubusercontent.com/1/plain.png\" alt=\"http\"></p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Expected behavior</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">An empty list.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/9000001/120000001-0a1b2c3d-1111-4a6b-8c7d-9e0f1a2b3c4d.png\"><img src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/9000001/120000001-0a1b2c3d-1111-4a6b-8c7d-9e0f1a2b3c4d.png\" alt=\"older upload\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"></a></p>",
